          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa khathesi iNkosi ithi: Phakathi kweminyaka emithathu elingana leminyaka yoqatshiweyo, udumo lukaMowabi luzadelelwa, lanxa elabantu abanengi; abazasala kibo bazakuba balutshwana kakhulu, bangabi lamandla.",
          "type": "text",
